 "about": "The player walks off towers 2.4, 6, 10 and 16 m high on the plaza: a fall of under 3 m costs no health, one from 3 m to 15 m costs 100 * (h - 3) / 12 (within 10%), and 15 m or more kills. Landing from 10 m and from 16 m the body goes limp at once (the limp metadata) and moves under physics with no bone under the ground; from 10 m the player gets up within 6 s. Then the player walks off a fifth tower, 16 m, and is killed 1.5 m into the fall: limp in mid-air, the hips fall at g within 20%. QA reads the health 12 s after each walk starts, time enough to land and get up, and sets it back to 100 before each tower.",
